'''Fairy Wings''' is an {{Epic}} item.

== Obtaining ==
'''Fairy Wings''' is obtained by hitting [[Fairy|Fairies]] in [[The Catacombs]] with {{Item|Enchanted Shears}} whilst the {{NPCSprite|Tyashoi Alchemist}} is in the {{zone|Village}}.

== Usage ==
{{Item|Great Spook Talisman|amount=1}} can be bought from the {{NPCSprite|Tyashoi Alchemist}} for {{Item|Fairy Wings|amount=5}}.

== Trivia ==
*Using regular [[shears]] with enchantments will prompt the following response: {{Dialogue|&d<name> the Fairy&f: I like your spirit, but those are not mysterious enough!}}

